  m_text: "7 \xB7 Moving Target \u2014 the wallet moves WHILE coins are in flight\nThey
    still land on it. The only code making that work is A2BDemoOscillate on the wallet.\nEndpoints
    resolve every frame and are never cached at play time \u2014\nbake the destination
    once (the obvious optimisation) and coins land where the wallet used to be."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
